do Global.mod_can_move(false)
weaponsmith: Void? This deep into Halcrya?
weaponsmith: What brings you here?
- Upgrading weapon
	[signal arg="upgrade_menu"]
- Learning about Halcrya
	weaponsmith: You may wonder how I am void and permitted to reside here...
	weaponsmith: They have deemed me to be "useful" to their cause.
	weaponsmith: Thus I am allowed to stay down here. Protected by the light.
	weaponsmith: . . .
	weaponsmith: The Zenith is scared of our kind.
	weaponsmith: So it chooses to oppress us so.
	weaponsmith: The power of the Void Nexus isn't great enough to overcome the light . . .
	weaponsmith: . . . and there's no other source of void in Halcrya.
	weaponsmith: . . .
	weaponsmith: Between us.
	weaponsmith: There may be a source of void somewhere in the underground.
	weaponsmith: A source larger than anything the light could even fathom.
	weaponsmith: Though reaching it will not be easy.
	weaponsmith: It may not even exist.
	weaponsmith: You did not hear this from me. Understood?
	weaponsmith: Good luck, void.
	do Global.mod_can_move(true)